[
  {
    "title": "Bits, Binary & Representation",
    "tag": "LESSON 01",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Topic 2.1 · Binary Numbers",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Bits, Binary<br>&amp; Representation</h1><p class=\"zh\">从二进制位到数据表示</p><p class=\"small\">90-minute lesson · Preparing for the May 2027 exam</p>",
    "note": "用两分钟说明课程目标：为 2027 年 5 月 AP CSP 大考建立基础，但第一课先掌握可解释、可迁移的二进制思维。告诉学生：屏幕和考试术语以英文为主，关键概念可用中文澄清。今天不需要编程基础。不要在封面展开所有后续单元。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Entry check",
    "tag": "ENTRY CHECK",
    "time": "2–5 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A · DAT-1.C.a",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Think first. Then compare with a partner.</p><ol><li>How many bits make one byte?</li><li>Does binary <span class=\"mono\">10</span> mean decimal ten?</li><li>Does one extra bit add just one possible pattern?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Eight bits.<br>2. No: <span class=\"mono\">10₂ = 2₁₀</span>.<br>3. No: one extra bit doubles the pattern count.</div></details>",
    "note": "先给 45–60 秒独立作答，再同桌互相解释一项，最后快速举手统计。此时答案用于诊断，不计分、不贴能力标签。第二题暴露“把二进制数字串直接当十进制”的误区；第三题检查是否理解组合数量。只简短揭晓，不提前完整讲解幂次。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The route to May 2027",
    "tag": "EXAM MAP",
    "time": "5–10 min",
    "code": "AP CSP · 2027 assessment",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><p class=\"big\">70%</p><p><strong>Multiple choice</strong><br>70 questions · 120 minutes</p><p class=\"small\">Includes single-select and select-two items.</p></div><div><p class=\"big\">30%</p><p><strong>Create + written responses</strong><br>Exam day: 2 questions, 4 prompts · 60 minutes</p><p class=\"small\">Submit code, video and your Personalized Project Reference.</p></div></div><p class=\"callout\"><strong>Exam:</strong> May 14, 2027 · Bluebook<br><strong>Create deadline:</strong> April 30, 2027, 11:59 p.m. ET</p><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"https://apcentral.collegeboard.org/courses/ap-computer-science-principles/exam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Exam structure</a> · <a href=\"https://apcentral.collegeboard.org/exam-administration-ordering-scores/exam-dates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official 2027 dates</a> · Checked September 8, 2026</p>",
    "note": "强调 70% 与 30% 是总成绩构成；30% 对应 Create 与考试当天书面回答的组合，不要误说视频单独占 30%。Create 有程序代码、视频和 PPR 三项提交，课堂须安排至少 9 小时完成正式任务。考试当天依据自己的 PPR 回答两题中的四个提示。选择题中有 8 道需要选两项，今天会练习此形式。官方常规考试日期为 2027 年 5 月 14 日 Session 1；若在中国大陆应试，UTC+08 的公布开考时间为 09:00，报到时间按考点要求。Create 截止保留官方 ET 表达；相当于北京时间 5 月 1 日 11:59，班级应设更早截止。不要把日期说明讲成整节备考讲座。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "10–12 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A · DAT-1.B · DAT-1.C.a / DAT-1.C.b",
    "html": "<ol><li>Explain <strong>bits, bytes and context</strong>.</li><li>Convert and compare <strong>binary integers</strong>.</li><li>Distinguish <strong>pattern count</strong> from <strong>maximum value</strong>.</li><li>Explain <strong>overflow</strong> and <strong>roundoff</strong>.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Today’s number examples use nonnegative, unsigned integers.</p><p class=\"small zh\">位与字节 · 进制转换 · 表示容量 · 数值表示的限制</p>",
    "note": "让学生选一个自己最不确定的目标，学习后再回看。说明本课使用非负整数的二进制编码；数值上限的推导以此约定为前提。课程标准 DAT-1.C.a 是正整数进制转换，课堂容量例子会自然包含代表零的全零模式。负数补码、十六进制、浮点格式位布局不在本课展开；这些并非都属于官方明确排除项。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Bits and bytes",
    "tag": "BUILDING BLOCKS",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.3–4 · Skill 3.C",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">A <strong>bit</strong> has two possible values: 0 or 1.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 228\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eight bit cells, 01001101, grouped by a bracket into one byte.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"110\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"233\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"285\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"479\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"531\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"602\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"654\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"725\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"777\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"848\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"971\" y=\"35\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1023\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><path d=\"M110 148L110 169\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M110 169L1075 169\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M1075 169L1075 148\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"592\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">8 positions × 1 bit = 1 byte</text></g></svg><figcaption>One byte groups eight bits; a bit is one position in the pattern.</figcaption></figure><details><summary>Show answer: three bytes?</summary><div class=\"answer\">3 × 8 = <strong>24 bits</strong>.</div></details><p class=\"small zh\">bit：位 ／ 二进制位 · byte：字节</p>",
    "note": "用开关两种状态说明 bit；不要把具体电压或开关当成 bit 的唯一物理实现。先让学生数出例子中的八个位置，再给出 byte 定义。板书 1 byte = 8 bits，提醒大写 B 与小写 b 常用于不同单位，但本课不扩展存储单位换算。最后口算三字节并追问“为什么乘 8”。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A pattern needs an interpretation",
    "tag": "INTERPRETATION",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.5–7 · Skill 3.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same bit pattern 01000001 is interpreted as integer 65 or cloudy using a supplied custom weather code.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"93\" width=\"330\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">01000001</text><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">the same eight bits</text><path d=\"M350 145L470 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M460 138L470 145L460 152\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M470 65L470 224\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M470 65L535 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M525 58L535 65L525 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M470 224L535 224\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M525 217L535 224L525 231\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"550\" y=\"12\" width=\"620\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"860.0\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Integer encoding → 65</text><text x=\"860.0\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">64 + 1</text><rect x=\"550\" y=\"172\" width=\"620\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"860.0\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Custom weather code → cloudy</text><text x=\"860.0\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">A mapping supplied by the program</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">The encoding and context determine the meaning.</p><p class=\"small zh\">同一比特模式可有不同含义；先看编码规则，再解释数据。</p>",
    "note": "先问学生能否仅凭这一串位断定它一定是数字。左侧是本课规定的整数解释；右侧是明确给出的自定义天气映射，不是任何通用天气标准。强调同一模式也能参与文本、图片、声音等表示，但必须知道编码规则。不要引入未提供的 ASCII 表，也不要求背字符编码。本页用于抽象和上下文，不要求学生提前熟练算出 65。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Counting bit patterns",
    "tag": "COMBINATIONS",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.6 · Skill 3.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 285\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A binary tree branches from 0 and 1 to four two-bit patterns, then eight three-bit patterns.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"65\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">1 bit</text><text x=\"65\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2 bits</text><text x=\"65\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">3 bits</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"18\" width=\"90\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><rect x=\"835\" y=\"18\" width=\"90\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">1</text><path d=\"M360 70L230 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"105\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">00</text><path d=\"M230 157L168 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">000</text><path d=\"M230 157L292 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"239\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"292\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">001</text><path d=\"M360 70L490 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"105\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">01</text><path d=\"M490 157L428 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"375\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"428\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">010</text><path d=\"M490 157L552 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"499\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">011</text><path d=\"M880 70L750 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"700\" y=\"105\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><path d=\"M750 157L688 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"635\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"688\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">100</text><path d=\"M750 157L812 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"759\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"812\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">101</text><path d=\"M880 70L1010 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"960\" y=\"105\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1010\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">11</text><path d=\"M1010 157L948 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"895\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"948\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">110</text><path d=\"M1010 157L1072 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"1019\" y=\"205\" width=\"106\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1072\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">111</text></g></svg><figcaption>At every new position, each existing pattern gets two possible extensions.</figcaption></figure><p class=\"equation\">n bits → 2ⁿ distinct patterns</p><p class=\"small\">Two choices at each position; multiply the choices.</p>",
    "note": "先只看一位，再让学生在每个已有模式前分别添 0 和 1，构造两位、三位的全部模式。追问是否遗漏全零模式。用乘法原理得到 2 × 2 × 2 = 8，最后推广为 2ⁿ。明确这是从位的两种状态推导的结论；现在数的是模式数量，还没有讨论“最大整数”。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Place value in base 2",
    "tag": "PLACE VALUE",
    "time": "24–27 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.1–5 · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Start at the right with 2⁰ = 1.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eight binary positions show weights 128,64,32,16,8,4,2,1. Moving left doubles the weight.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"18\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">128</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2⁷</text><rect x=\"167\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"233\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">64</text><text x=\"233\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2⁶</text><rect x=\"316\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">32</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2⁵</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"531\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">16</text><text x=\"531\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2⁴</text><rect x=\"614\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><text x=\"680\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2³</text><rect x=\"763\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"829\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><text x=\"829\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2²</text><rect x=\"912\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"978\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><text x=\"978\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2¹</text><rect x=\"1061\" y=\"58\" width=\"132\" height=\"114\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1127\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><text x=\"1127\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2⁰</text><path d=\"M1130 210L74 210\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M84 203L74 210L84 217\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"605\" y=\"247\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Move one position left → multiply the weight by 2</text><text x=\"1125\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Start here</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">Add the weights of the positions containing <strong>1</strong>.</p>",
    "note": "联系十进制的个位、十位、百位，但快速转回二进制。一定从最右侧的 1 开始，避免把最低位误记为 2。让学生口头从右到左报 1、2、4、8、16、32、64、128，再从左到右读一遍。解释 0 表示该位置权重不加入总和。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An eight-bit number",
    "tag": "INTERACTIVE LAB",
    "time": "27–30 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Toggle a bit. Predict the change before you click.</p><div id=\"bits\" class=\"bit-controls\"></div><div class=\"demo-bottom\"><output id=\"bit-value\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output><button id=\"reset-bits\">Reset</button><button id=\"increment-bits\">+1</button></div><p id=\"bit-sum\" class=\"small mono\"></p><p id=\"bit-message\" class=\"small\"></p><p class=\"small\">Try 8 → 9 → 10. Then build 42.</p>",
    "note": "先只打开权重 8 的位置，追问打开最右一位会增加多少；再试 9 到 10，让学生观察进位不是简单再加一个 1 位。请一名学生构造 42 = 32 + 8 + 2，其余学生核对。此活动限时三分钟；不在这里展开溢出。如果点击到边界，说明本演示只有八个可见位置，后面将正式区分字段容量与 AP 伪代码。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Decode 101101",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "time": "30–35 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<table class=\"bit-table\"><thead><tr><th>32</th><th>16</th><th>8</th><th>4</th><th>2</th><th>1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"lead\">Which weights contribute to the value?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"equation\">32 + 8 + 4 + 1 = 45</p><p class=\"mono\">101101₂ = 45₁₀</p></div></details><p class=\"small\">Zeros keep their positions; they contribute zero.</p>",
    "note": "按“标权重—选 1 位—求和”的固定步骤示范。不要一看到数字就直接报 45。邀请学生指出为什么 16 和 2 不参与求和，并解释模式中间的 0 不能删掉。让学生跟写完整等式；确认二进制下标 2 与十进制下标 10 表示进制，不是乘法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Your turn: decode and explain",
    "tag": "INDEPENDENT PRACTICE",
    "time": "35–40 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><p><strong>A</strong></p><p class=\"big mono\">01011010</p></div><div><p><strong>B</strong></p><p class=\"big mono\">1001</p></div></div><p>Write the contributing weights and the decimal value.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>A: 64 + 16 + 8 + 2 = <strong>90</strong>.</p><p>B: 8 + 1 = <strong>9</strong>.</p><p>Leading zeros do not change an integer's value.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "给两分钟独立作答，一分钟同桌核对，余下两分钟讲评。A 检查八位对齐与前导零，B 检查学生是否不论长度都从右侧 1 开始。先收集常见错误再揭晓答案。若出现 180 或 18，说明起始权重错了一位；若删除内部零，回到上一页说明位置不能改变。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Encode decimal 53",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "time": "40–45 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Choose powers of two until the remainder is zero.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 204\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Subtract 32 from 53 to get 21, then 16 to get 5, then 4 to get 1, then 1 to reach zero.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"35\" width=\"185\" height=\"94\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">53</text><path d=\"M215 81L266 81\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M256 74L266 81L256 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">−32</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"35\" width=\"185\" height=\"94\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">21</text><path d=\"M455 81L506 81\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M496 74L506 81L496 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"477\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">−16</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"35\" width=\"185\" height=\"94\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"602\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><path d=\"M695 81L746 81\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M736 74L746 81L736 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"717\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">−4</text><rect x=\"750\" y=\"35\" width=\"185\" height=\"94\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"842\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><path d=\"M935 81L986 81\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M976 74L986 81L976 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"957\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">−1</text><rect x=\"990\" y=\"35\" width=\"185\" height=\"94\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1082\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Selected weights: 32 + 16 + 4 + 1</text></g></svg><figcaption>Mark a 1 at each selected weight; mark a 0 at the unused weights.</figcaption></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"mono\">53₁₀ = 110101₂ = 00110101₂</p><p>Use leading zeros when exactly eight bits are required.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "现场写余数链：53 − 32 = 21，21 − 16 = 5，5 − 4 = 1，1 − 1 = 0。把未选中的 8、2 位置写成 0，强调不能只串起用到的 1。最短表示为 110101；题目若指定八位，再在左侧补两个零。最后用求和反向验证 53，建立自检习惯。也接受学生已有的连续除 2 取余法，但不同时再完整讲另一套流程。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Encode and compare",
    "tag": "TRANSFER PRACTICE",
    "time": "45–50 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a / DAT-1.C.b · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p><strong>A.</strong> Encode decimal <strong>38</strong> using exactly eight bits.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> Order these binary integers from smallest to largest:</p><p class=\"mono lead\">00101111 &nbsp; 00110000 &nbsp; 00011111</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>A: 38 = 32 + 4 + 2 → <span class=\"mono\">00100110</span>.</p><p>B: <span class=\"mono\">00011111 &lt; 00101111 &lt; 00110000</span><br>Decimal check: 31 &lt; 47 &lt; 48.</p></div></details><p class=\"small\">For equal-length patterns, compare from the left.</p>",
    "note": "独立两分钟完成编码，再给一分钟排序和同桌解释。比较时位数相同，可以从左向右找到首个不同位；位数不同时先用前导零对齐。要求至少一人不用全部转十进制也能解释 00101111 小于 00110000。讲评中保留十进制换算作为验证，不把它当成唯一解法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Count and maximum value",
    "tag": "KEY DISTINCTION",
    "time": "50–55 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.6 · DAT-1.C · Teaching deduction",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 246\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eight three-bit patterns from 000 through 111 correspond to integers zero through seven.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"94\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">000</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">001</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"322\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">010</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"468\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"532\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">011</text><text x=\"532\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"614\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"678\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">100</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"760\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"824\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">101</text><text x=\"824\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><rect x=\"906\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"970\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">110</text><text x=\"970\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">6</text><rect x=\"1052\" y=\"42\" width=\"128\" height=\"102\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1116\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">111</text><text x=\"1116\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">7</text><path d=\"M30 166L30 184\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M30 184L1180 184\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M1180 184L1180 166\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">8 patterns in total · values run from 0 to 7</text></g></svg></figure><div class=\"visual-row\"><div class=\"concept-card\"><h3>Pattern count: 2ⁿ</h3><p class=\"visual-note\">Count every pattern, including all zeros.</p></div><div class=\"concept-card\"><h3>Largest integer: 2ⁿ − 1</h3><p class=\"visual-note\">For nonnegative encoding, counting starts at zero.</p></div></div><p class=\"small\">6 bits: 64 patterns / max 63 · 8 bits: 256 patterns / max 255</p>",
    "note": "这是本课最重要的区分。先列三位的 000 到 111，对应整数 0 到 7，让学生亲自数有八个值。指出“最大的编号”和“编号的数量”不同。再解释 n 位非负整数范围 0 到 2ⁿ − 1。此公式依赖指定的非负整数解释，不直接套用于带符号数或浮点数。用六位追问：64 是数量，63 才是最大值。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "How many bits for 70 categories?",
    "tag": "MINIMUM CAPACITY",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.6 · DAT-1.C · Teaching deduction",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Assign one unique, fixed-length code to each category.</p><p class=\"small\">All patterns are available; none are reserved.</p><p class=\"equation\">2⁶ = 64 &lt; 70 ≤ 128 = 2⁷</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p><strong>Seven bits per code.</strong></p><p>Six bits are insufficient. Seven bits are sufficient.</p><p class=\"small\">128 − 70 = 58 patterns remain unused.</p></div></details><p class=\"callout\">Prove both: your length works, and one fewer bit fails.</p>",
    "note": "不要让学生把类别总数当成要编码的单个数后机械转换；这里需要 70 个不同的模式。要求完整证明最小值：六位的 64 个不够，七位的 128 个足够。说明题目约定没有保留码，因此全零模式也能作为一个类别的代码。若学生说七位最多 127 个类别，回到上一页区分最大数值与模式数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "One more bit",
    "tag": "CAPACITY GROWTH",
    "time": "60–64 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.6 · Teaching deduction",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 285\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A five-bit pattern 10110 has two six-bit extensions by prefixing 0 or 1.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"85\" width=\"340\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">10110</text><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one old five-bit pattern</text><path d=\"M380 138L520 138\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M510 131L520 138L510 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M520 65L520 218\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M520 65L620 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M610 58L620 65L610 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M520 218L620 218\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M610 211L620 218L610 225\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"630\" y=\"14\" width=\"520\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0 | 10110</text><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">prefix a 0</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"166\" width=\"520\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8f2ef\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1 | 10110</text><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">or prefix a 1</text></g></svg><figcaption>Every old pattern gets two distinct extensions, so the total doubles.</figcaption></figure><p class=\"equation\">+1 bit → ×2 patterns &nbsp; · &nbsp; +3 bits → ×8</p><p class=\"small\">5 bits: 32 patterns → 6 bits: 64 patterns</p>",
    "note": "用任意旧模式 101 演示新模式 0101 与 1101，说明不是只多出两个整体模式，而是每个旧模式都分成两种。让学生先口答增加两位是多少倍，再回答三位八倍。区分“变成原来的八倍”与“增加了八倍”这类语言歧义；英文统一使用 eight times as many patterns。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Overflow",
    "tag": "OVERFLOW",
    "time": "64–68 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.B.1 · Skill 1.D",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Fixed eight-bit, nonnegative field: 255 + 1 = 256.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 276\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The nine-bit binary representation of 256 exceeds an eight-position storage field. The leading one lies outside the field.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"181\" y=\"72\" width=\"960\" height=\"142\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"680\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Only eight stored positions are available</text><rect x=\"74\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#faebe6\" stroke=\"#a64d3b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#a64d3b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"193\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"312\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"361\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"431\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"550\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"599\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"669\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"718\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"788\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"837\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"907\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"956\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"1026\" y=\"101\" width=\"98\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1075\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><text x=\"119\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a64d3b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">extra bit</text><text x=\"680\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">256 = 100000000₂ needs nine bits</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\"><strong>Overflow:</strong> a value exceeds the representation’s capacity.</p><p class=\"small\">The stored result depends on the system; no wraparound rule is given.</p>",
    "note": "首先读清前提：明确指定八位、非负、整数。数学上的和为 256，二进制需要九位，因此八位字段装不下。不要教成“255 + 1 永远等于 0”；本题没有定义溢出后的实现行为，可能报错或采用其他处理。也不要求学生计算截断或补码。重点是解释问题来自有限容量。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The AP pseudocode integer model",
    "tag": "EXAM LANGUAGE",
    "time": "68–72 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.B.2 · Skill 1.D",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\">value ← 255\nvalue ← value + 1\nDISPLAY(value)</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"equation\">256</p></div></details><p class=\"callout\">In the AP reference language, integer size is bounded by available memory.</p><p class=\"small\">Apply a fixed bit limit only when the question supplies one.</p>",
    "note": "先不揭晓，让学生投票 0、255、256，观察上一页是否形成错误迁移。然后明确 CED DAT-1.B.2：考试参考表伪代码的整数仅受可用内存限制，不能默认只有八位。因此这段程序显示 256。把两页并列说清楚：上一页额外给了八位字段前提，这一页没有。不要展开具体语言整数实现。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Roundoff",
    "tag": "ROUNDOFF",
    "time": "72–75 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.B.3 · Skill 1.D",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Decimal analogy: ⅓ ≈ 0.333.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 285\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"On a magnified number line, stored decimal 0.333 lies to the left of exact one-third, leaving a small positive gap.\"><g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><path d=\"M100 125L1110 125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0.3330</text><text x=\"1110\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0.3334</text><path d=\"M100 115L100 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M353 115L353 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M605 115L605 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M858 115L858 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M1110 115L1110 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"125\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"942\" cy=\"125\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Stored: 0.333</text><text x=\"935\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Exact: ⅓</text><path d=\"M100 220L942 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Gap = ⅓ − 0.333 = 0.000333…</text></g></svg><figcaption>Magnified decimal view: the stored approximation is close, but not exact.</figcaption></figure><p class=\"callout\"><strong>Roundoff:</strong> limited precision creates a difference from the exact value.</p><p class=\"small\">More bits can improve precision; they do not make it unlimited.</p>",
    "note": "说明 0.333 是帮助理解的十进制类比，不是在宣称计算机内部采用这串十进制数存储。三分之一无限展开，截为有限位后就不是完全相等；这里讨论近似精度，不是整数太大装不下。课堂将这种有限表示产生的误差归于 roundoff。实数可表示范围的具体限制属于官方排除内容，不讲 IEEE-754 的位分配、特殊值或数值范围。 图解使用：先让学生按标签读图，再用一句话说明图中变化或关系；练习答案仍在学生作答后展开。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Official sample practice",
    "tag": "OFFICIAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "75–79 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.b · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">College Board CED · Sample Question 2</p><p><a href=\"resources/AP_CSP_Course_and_Exam_Description.pdf#page=182\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the question → printed p. 175 / PDF p. 182</a></p><ol><li>Read the student-ID context carefully.</li><li>Choose the next binary ID.</li><li>Explain the ordering in one sentence.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p><strong>A.</strong> Last ID: <span class=\"mono\">10010011₂ = 147</span>.<br>Next ID: <span class=\"mono\">10010100₂ = 148</span>.</p><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"resources/AP_CSP_Course_and_Exam_Description.pdf#page=194\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official key: printed p. 187 / PDF p. 194</a></p></div></details>",
    "note": "本页是官方公开 CED 样题链接，不是自编题，也不要称作历年真题。点击本地 PDF，显示 PDF 第 182 页，即纸面页码 175 的第 2 题。给学生约 90 秒独立选择，再用一分钟解释连续二进制 ID 的顺序；根据尾部位判断进位，也可转成十进制核对。已核对原题：最后的 ID 是 10010011（147），加 1 后是 10010100（148），对应 A。官方答案 A，纸面答案页 187、PDF 第 194 页，能力对应 DAT-1.C.b / 2.B。课前检查链接并定位好页面；不要把 PDF 页码与印刷页码混用。"
  },
  {
    "title": "AP-style multiple select",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL AP-STYLE PRACTICE",
    "time": "79–82 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A.6 · DAT-1.C · Teaching deduction",
    "html": "<p>A field uses six bits for nonnegative binary integers.</p><ol class=\"options\" type=\"A\"><li>There are 64 distinct six-bit patterns.</li><li>The largest represented integer is 64.</li><li>Increasing the field to seven bits gives 128 patterns.</li><li>Adding leading zeros changes an integer's value.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>A and C.</strong> Six bits give 64 patterns but a maximum of 63. Seven bits give 128 patterns. Leading zeros preserve the value.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Original practice item; not an official AP question.</p>",
    "note": "提醒必须且只能选两项，先逐项判断再提交，不要找到一个正确选项就停。让学生用一句话反驳 B 与 D。A 正确是 2⁶ = 64；B 把最大整数与数量混淆；C 正确是 2⁷ = 128；D 错误，前导零不会改变各个 1 的位置权重。此题为原创 AP 风格练习，与上一页官方样题明确区分。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Four errors to catch",
    "tag": "ERROR CHECK",
    "time": "82–85 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A · DAT-1.B · DAT-1.C",
    "html": "<table class=\"error-table\"><thead><tr><th>Common error</th><th>Correction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Binary 10 means decimal ten.</td><td>10₂ = 2₁₀.</td></tr><tr><td>The maximum n-bit integer is 2ⁿ.</td><td>For nonnegative encoding: 2ⁿ − 1.</td></tr><tr><td>One extra bit adds one pattern.</td><td>One extra bit doubles the count.</td></tr><tr><td>Every representation error is overflow.</td><td>Capacity → overflow.<br>Approximation → roundoff.</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"small\">Explain the correction; do not just memorize the formula.</p>",
    "note": "采用快速纠错：每行先让学生说出错误，再由另一名学生给依据。第一行回到位权，第二行回到全零模式也占一个编号，第三行回到每个旧模式分成两种，第四行回到容量与精度。若第二行仍有多名学生犹豫，离堂票后暂缓进入下一课，安排针对性重练。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "CHECK & NEXT STEP",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · DAT-1.A.6 · DAT-1.B.3",
    "html": "<ol><li>Convert <span class=\"mono\">00110110</span> to decimal.</li><li>Give the largest seven-bit nonnegative integer.</li><li>Find the minimum bits for <strong>90 unique codes</strong>; no patterns are reserved.</li><li>Classify <span class=\"mono\">⅓ ≈ 0.333</span> and explain why.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. 32 + 16 + 4 + 2 = <strong>54</strong>.<br>2. 2⁷ − 1 = <strong>127</strong>.<br>3. <strong>7 bits</strong>: 64 &lt; 90 ≤ 128.<br>4. <strong>Roundoff</strong>: a finite approximation differs from the exact value.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Next: complete the Lesson 01 homework and correct errors with reasons.</p>",
    "note": "给三分钟独立作答，最后两分钟收集并口头反馈。每项一分，仅作为教师诊断，不等同 AP 官方评分。第 1 项 54；第 2 项 127；第 3 项七位，要求 64 不足而 128 足够的理由；第 4 项 roundoff，并指出有限近似不等于精确值。4/4 表示掌握；3/4 且第 2 项正确可带着针对性订正继续；0–2/4 或第 2 项错误，先重练位权与“数量对最大值”。布置同文件夹的作业 PDF，提示六道选择题加六道课堂书面练习，共 30 个教师分值；这些书面题不是官方考试 FRQ。"
  }
]
